Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): expose Wire Contour skims and slug retention

Add ordered skim controls, machine condition choices, tab fields and the
capture declaration to the existing operation draft and Apply workflow.
Pin editing, undo, named refusals, unknown conditions and list limits.

Fixes #1148
